## Implementation Notes

- Use `export interface` for all types (prefer interfaces over types for objects)
- Add JSDoc comments explaining each interface's role in the data flow
- AISummary.keyPoints MUST be tuple `[string, string, string]`, not `string[]` (enforces exactly 3)
- Config interface should match .env.example structure from SETUP-001
- Date type for timestamps (not string) - will be parsed from Gmail API

## Example Usage

```typescript
// Example of how these types connect:
